WEBVTT

00:02:58.883 --> 00:03:00.927
save up, little by little,

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:03.846
for the improved seeds
and fertilizer they need.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:07.600
Together, these help improve harvests

00:03:07.642 --> 00:03:10.144
and generate a 3x return
on their investment.

00:03:11.687 --> 00:03:13.898
Here's how the program works.

00:03:13.898 --> 00:03:16.901
We start with a young
entrepreneur like Demba.

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:20.488
We equip him with a smartphone
and our app, myAgro Connect,

00:03:20.529 --> 00:03:23.324
so that he can manage his sales territory.

00:03:23.616 --> 00:03:26.369
At harvest time, Demba
visits farmers in his village

00:03:26.369 --> 00:03:29.080
and asks them if they want to sign up
for a myAgro package

00:03:29.121 --> 00:03:31.123
to improve their harvest and income.